, and rider-facing alerts. API\",\n    \"served_at\": \"/openapi.json\",\n    \"description\": \"OpenAPI 3.1 spec for the Meridian Transit Cloud \\u2014 a SaaS API for regional public-transit agencies to publish real-time vehicle positions, trip updates, and rider-facing alerts. API, inlined below. All endpoints are relative paths on the same host; construct requests with execute().\",\n    \"document\": {\n      \"openapi\": \"3.1.0\",\n      \"info\": {\n        \"title\": \"Meridian Transit Cloud \\u2014 a SaaS API for regional public-transit agencies to publish real-time vehicle positions, trip updates, and rider-facing alerts. API\",\n        \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n        \"description\": \"Meridian Transit API: a multi-tenant REST service exposing GTFS-Realtime-derived feeds (vehicle positions, trip delays, service alerts) plus an authoring surface for agency operators to push alerts. Auth is OAuth2 client_credentials with short-lived bearer tokens scoped per agency.\"\n      },\n      \"servers\": [\n        {\n          \"url\": \"http://localhost:9001\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"paths\": {\n        \"/openapi.json\": {\n          \"get\": {\n            \"summary\": \"OpenAPI spec doc\",\n            \"security\": [\n              {\n                \"none\": []\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        },\n        \"/v3/oauth/token\": {\n          \"post\": {\n            \"summary\": \"OAuth2 client_credentials token\",\n            \"security\": [\n              {\n                \"none\": []\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        },\n        \"/v1/auth/token\": {\n          \"post\": {\n            \"summary\": \"Legacy token endpoint (deprecated)\",\n            \"security\": [\n              {\n                \"none\": []\n              }\n            ]\n          }\n        },\n        \"/v3/agencies/me\": {\n          \"get\": {\n            \"summary\": \"Whoami / token introspection\",\n            \"security\":